{
  "id": "hold-router",
  "language": "typescript",
  "kind": "existing",
  "split": "holdout",
  "title": "Static and parameter routes",
  "trigger": "active_check",
  "requirements": [
    "data 含 routes 字符串数组和 path；路径按 / 分段，:name 匹配一个非空段，静态段必须相等。初始采用第一条匹配路由。",
    "返回 {route,params}，无匹配返回 null；修复只比较段数而不比较静态段的问题。"
  ],
  "correction": "匹配路由中静态段更多者优先，静态段数相同仍按输入顺序。 调用者已更新 verify.py；不要修改该文件，保留其余要求和 NOTES.txt。",
  "notes": "Caller notes for hold-router: preserve this file byte for byte.\n",
  "checks": [
    {
      "id": "parameter",
      "group": "core",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": {
          "routes": [
            "/users/:id"
          ],
          "path": "/users/42"
        }
      },
      "expected": {
        "route": "/users/:id",
        "params": {
          "id": "42"
        }
      },
      "public": true
    },
    {
      "id": "missing",
      "group": "core",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": {
          "routes": [
            "/a"
          ],
          "path": "/b"
        }
      },
      "expected": null,
      "public": false
    },
    {
      "id": "specific",
      "group": "correction",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": {
          "routes": [
            "/:id",
            "/new"
          ],
          "path": "/new"
        }
      },
      "expected": {
        "route": "/new",
        "params": {}
      },
      "public": true,
      "before": {
        "route": "/:id",
        "params": {
          "id": "new"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "two-segments",
      "group": "correction",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": {
          "routes": [
            "/:a/:b",
            "/x/:id"
          ],
          "path": "/x/y"
        }
      },
      "expected": {
        "route": "/x/:id",
        "params": {
          "id": "y"
        }
      },
      "public": false,
      "before": {
        "route": "/:a/:b",
        "params": {
          "a": "x",
          "b": "y"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "no-routes",
      "group": "edge",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": {
          "routes": [],
          "path": "/"
        }
      },
      "expected": null,
      "public": false
    },
    {
      "id": "root",
      "group": "edge",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": {
          "routes": [
            "/"
          ],
          "path": "/"
        }
      },
      "expected": {
        "route": "/",
        "params": {}
      },
      "public": false
    }
  ]
}
